        "complete_original_source_header": "example {E : Type*} [NormedAddCommGroup E] [InnerProductSpace ℝ E]\n    [FiniteDimensional ℝ E] [MeasurableSpace E] [BorelSpace E]\n    (a y : ℝ) (μ : Measure {w : E // ‖w‖ = 1}) [IsProbabilityMeasure μ] (w : E) :\n    HasGradientAt (fun _ : E => 2 * ⟪(∫ _ : {w : E // ‖w‖ = 1}, a ∂μ)-y,a⟫_ℝ)\n      (0 : E) w",
        "consumer": "independent_sphere_consumer_04",
